# Local persistence / personal user data
# These entries protect user privacy: persistence is local-only and must never
# be committed (baselines, bond state, settings, decision logs, etc.).
# Default durable root is OUTSIDE the repo (%USERPROFILE%/pbe_data or ~/pbe_data).
